sonal Strife in the  real world with Luffy and his friends  realizing this scheme would effectively  Rob Humanity of its Free Will in the  process they move to stop her however  utta herself undergoes a shocking  Discovery when she realizes her powers  are responsible for devastating eligia  in the first place this sets utta on a  path for Redemption and one that she  still may be pursuing should the  character resurface in the anime series  Beyond her flashback appearances to  Luffy's childhood Luffy's long-lost  friend may have been introduced as a pop  Idol with adoring masses but like many  characters in one piece she has a dark  history to overcome the rubber-like  powers Luffy gained after eating a piece  of devil fruit has led him to achieve  various combat Transformations as he  continues to awaken his latent potential  red features Luffy's most powerful  transformed state yet known as gear 5 as  he battles an ancient demon residing  within the dream world that threatens to  break free into the waking world in the  comics Luffy first achieves the gear 5  transformation during the wano country  storyline in the middle of his final  showdown against the villainous kaido  now aware of the full extent of his  connection to the devil fruit Luffy  gains absolute Mastery over his powers  as he unveils this combat transformation  in red Luffy transforms into gear 5 to  take on the demon taught musica within  the dream world having grown visibly  accustomed to the ability use the new  form grandson this suggests that Luffy  won't have any issues tapping into his  gear 5 potential moving forward one  piece has introduced different Realms  and dimensions to the narrative's  material world one Piece Film red goes  one step further by prominently  featuring a dream world connected to  utta through her music with devastating  implications for the waking world  through Power is gained by eating a  devil fruit UTA can draw people who hear  her music into the dreaming world 